      "q": "Is it up to date?",
      "a": "Latest found is 140.11.0 (May 18, 2026) on ESR 140, which trails the current Firefox ESR 153."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is it the same as Firefox?",
      "a": "It is Firefox ESR with proprietary bits and tracking removed."
